== 4. weighted floor (alpha 0.1, beta 0.95): 29 / (n_eff/n)
  none: n_eff/n=1.0: n_min ~ 29
  moderate: n_eff/n=0.73: n_min ~ 40
  strong: n_eff/n=0.34: n_min ~ 86
  O10 strong: n_eff/n=0.35: n_min ~ 83
  O10 mild: n_eff/n=0.72: n_min ~ 41
